usage: module-find.py [root] grep [-h] [--json] [--csv] [--limit N] [--source]
                                  regex

positional arguments:
  regex          Python regex, case-insensitive

options:
  -h, --help     show this help message and exit
  --json         machine JSON output
  --csv          CSV output (header + rows)
  --limit, -n N  print at most N rows (default: all); the cut is reported
  --source       search every line of every .java file (file:line text)
